  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening East Pacific leatherback conservation through regional coordination of monitoring, outreach, and policy efforts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) maintain regional database, website and online library of best management practices for Laud OOP; (2) facilitate alignment of IAC leatherback taskforce priorities with Laud OPO; (3) accompany IAC Secretariat as technical expert to meetings with high level government officials and International Fisheries bodies to address leatherback fisheries bycatch; and (4) coordinate one Laud OPO workshop annually to review ongoing projects and activities and consult about problems, needs, and successful means to further recovery efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
